                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration KSV-0104**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Kubernetes Security Check|MEDIUM|Seccomp policies disabled|container \"app\" of pod \"demo\" in \"default\" namespace should specify a seccomp profile|[KSV-0104](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0104)|\n\nA program inside the container can bypass Seccomp protection policies."
              },
              "properties": {
